COMPILATION steps-

1) Preprocessor : i/p= .c    -headerfile(declaration error)
                  o/p= .i    - removes comments
                             - macroreplacement
                             - conditional compilation.
2) Translator  : i/p= .i     - Syntax errors
                 o/p= .s     - convert code to ASM file

3) Assembler   : i/p= .s     
                 o/p= .o     - convert code into opcodes

4) Linker   : i/p= .o        - adds OS information
              o/p= .a.out    - links with library( defnition errors)


ERRORS  -           compile time errors   and   runtime errors
                    preprocessor                 segmentation fault
                    Translator                   bus error
                    Linker                       floating point exception error.
